My dress is a ivory with gold\/champagne beading and my girls are wearing coral. I think I want them to wear beige pants and a white top but I&#039;m worried the white tops are just too plain... I would love to see some pics of other brides and what their guys wore with a similar gown! I&#039;ll try to attach pictures but my dress is Quincy by Maggie sottero and the girls are wearing from David&#039;s bridal Short Crinkle Chiffon Dress with Front Cascade in coral reef.\n\nAny suggestions is appreciated :)","Attachments":[{"Id":33498,"Name":"image.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2015\/post-282892-0-33211100-1440374496.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2015\/post-282892-0-33211100-1440374496_thumb.jpg","Width":640,"Height":1136},{"Id":33499,"Name":"image.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2015\/post-282892-0-99712900-1440374509.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2015\/post-282892-0-99712900-1440374509_thumb.jpg","Width":554,"Height":891}],"Id":1903159,"PostDate":1440360116,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi!<br>\nI am having a hard time deciding what colors to have my groom and his men to wear. My dress is a ivory with gold\/champagne beading and my girls are wearing coral. I think I want them to wear beige pants and a white top but I'm worried the white tops are just too plain... I would love to see some pics of other brides and what their guys wore with a similar gown! I'll try to attach pictures but my dress is Quincy by Maggie sottero and the girls are wearing from David's bridal Short Crinkle Chiffon Dress with Front Cascade in coral reef.<br>\nAny suggestions is appreciated <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ton_03@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"142.67.2.225","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1430216976,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282892.jpg?_r=1434622094","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"FutureMrsVanthof","Id":282892,"Name":"FutureMrsVanthof","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.42.106","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79525,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5069dae015eff155ffbf6e6d498b3bb4","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;My vote would be for grey for the guys. With coral it would really look good. Or you could also do navy with the coral. Both wold look great. Would you consider having them add a vest that would change the plain? You could still do the white shirts but the vest would break it up a bit. Just a thought.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1903168,"PostDate":1440365631,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>My vote would be for grey for the guys. With coral it would really look good. Or you could also do navy with the coral. Both wold look great. Would you consider having them add a vest that would change the plain? You could still do the white shirts but the vest would break it up a bit. Just a thought.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79525","Title":"Groomsmen Suggestions !","LastPostDate":1440365631},"Pages":{"TotalItems":2,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
