data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/282132-katiemcbride\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">KatieMcBride<\/span><\/a> Love those! Hope they work out for you.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>- Erin<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My planning thread:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268<\/a>","Email":"ekjzwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1417435045,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"vancouverpetunia","Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.15.187","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78435,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c58a3ea80d59014c0692edd2c4df9ef4","RawContent":"[quote name=\"maybeoneday\" post=\"1900265\" timestamp=\"1436679845\"]\nReally can&#039;t decide whether to wear &#039;Barefoot Sandals&#039;\n\n[img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=33034\"]Screenshot_2015-07-12-06-29-41-1.png[\/url]\n\nor shoes...\n\n[img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=33035\"]Screenshot_2015-07-12-06-30-18-1.png[\/url]\n\nMight just get both then decide on the day.\n\nCan&#039;t seem to find any nice ivory flat sandals anywhere in shops near me. Might have to stop being so picky x\n\nMaybeoneday\n14 \/10\/2015 - R R C, Mexico[\/quote]\n\nLove the shoes!!  I couldn&#039;t wear them lol but I love them! Why not get both?? It&#039;s your wedding after all! If it&#039;s in the budget,l spoil yourself!!\n[quote name=\"KatieMcBride\" post=\"1900343\" timestamp=\"1436822555\"]\nI ended up ordering these\n\n[url=\"http:\/\/www.jcpenney.com\/unisa-lorainy-glitter-t-strap-sandals\/prod.jump?ppId=pp5005090622&amp;amp;catId=cat100240063&amp;amp;deptId=dept20000013&amp;amp;N=100330018&amp;amp;Nao=72&amp;amp;pageSize=72&amp;amp;pN=2&amp;amp;extDim=true&amp;amp;topDim=Categories&amp;amp;topDimvalue=sandals+%26+flip+flops&amp;amp;dimCombo=Categories%7C&amp;amp;dimComboVal=sandals+%26+flip+flops%7C&amp;amp;currentDim=Categories&amp;amp;currentDimVal=sandals+%26+flip+flops&amp;amp;N=100330018&amp;amp;_dyncharset=UTF-8&amp;amp;colorizedImg=DP0224201517020256M.tif\"]http:\/\/www.jcpenney.com\/unisa-lorainy-glitter-t-strap-sandals\/prod.jump?ppId=pp5005090622&amp;amp;catId=cat100240063&amp;amp;deptId=dept20000013&amp;amp;N=100330018&amp;amp;Nao=72&amp;amp;pageSize=72&amp;amp;pN=2&amp;amp;extDim=true&amp;amp;topDim=Categories&amp;amp;topDimvalue=sandals+%26+flip+flops&amp;amp;dimCombo=Categories|&amp;amp;dimComboVal=sandals+%26+flip+flops|&amp;amp;currentDim=Categories&amp;amp;currentDimVal=sandals+%26+flip+flops&amp;amp;N=100330018&amp;amp;_dyncharset=UTF-8&amp;amp;colorizedImg=DP0224201517020256M.tif[\/url]\n\nHope they look as good in person!![\/quote]\n Oh I like those too!! Nice and sparkly and they look comfy!\n\nYou ladies are doing nothing for a certain somebody&#039;s shoe addiction..... (me)","Attachments":[],"Id":1900369,"PostDate":1436822076,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>maybeoneday, on 12 July 2015 - 01:44 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Really can't decide whether to wear 'Barefoot Sandals'<br><br><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=33034' class='bbc_url' title=''>Screenshot_2015-07-12-06-29-41-1.png<\/a><br><br>\nor shoes...<br><br><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=33035' class='bbc_url' title=''>Screenshot_2015-07-12-06-30-18-1.png<\/a><br><br>\nMight just get both then decide on the day.<br><br>\nCan't seem to find any nice ivory flat sandals anywhere in shops near me. Might have to stop being so picky x<br><br>\nMaybeoneday<br>\n14 \/10\/2015 - R R C, Mexico<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Love the shoes!!\u00a0 I couldn't wear them lol but I love them! Why not get both?? It's your wedding after all! If it's in the budget,l spoil yourself!!<\/p><br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>KatieMcBride, on 13 July 2015 - 05:22 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I ended up ordering these<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.jcpenney.com\/unisa-lorainy-glitter-t-strap-sandals\/prod.jump?ppId=pp5005090622&catId=cat100240063&deptId=dept20000013&N=100330018&Nao=72&pageSize=72&pN=2&extDim=true&topDim=Categories&topDimvalue=sandals+%26+flip+flops&dimCombo=Categories%7C&dimComboVal=sandals+%26+flip+flops%7C&currentDim=Categories&currentDimVal=sandals+%26+flip+flops&N=100330018&_dyncharset=UTF-8&colorizedImg=DP0224201517020256M.tif' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.jcpenney....1517020256M.tif<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hope they look as good in person!!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0Oh I like those too!! Nice and sparkly and they look comfy!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You ladies are doing nothing for a certain somebody's shoe addiction..... (me)<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"199.85.228.129","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78435,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8310b76ea66c8261a8326b930df223c3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thanks guys! I&#039;ll post a pic when I receive them! I&#039;m all about sparkles, haha.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1900425,"PostDate":1436877067,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thanks guys! I'll post a pic when I receive them! I'm all about sparkles, haha.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"katie_mcbride48@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"199.85.228.129","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424099850,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282132.jpg?_r=1437519508","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"KatieMcBride","Id":282132,"Name":"KatieMcBride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"201.116.201.71","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78435,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9a7d3ba5def421fb5ebf3d6564b385e4","RawContent":"&lt;div&gt;Hi Girls..&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;Our venue is on a Beach named Las Caletas is a totally Private Paradise. &amp;nbsp;Most of our brides have selected this kind of shoes, simple but really&amp;nbsp;beautiful and perfect for a beach destination Wedding!!&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81725]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Adventure Weddings&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Puerto Vallarta, Mexico&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Toll Free: 1.866.731.81.52&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1900953,"PostDate":1437581433,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div>Hi Girls..<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>Our venue is on a Beach named Las Caletas is a totally Private Paradise. \u00a0Most of our brides have selected this kind of shoes, simple but really\u00a0beautiful and perfect for a beach destination Wedding!!<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/81725-shoes\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_10944\/sml_gallery_258213_10944_85287.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='shoes'  width='200' height='200'  alt='shoes' id='sml_image_view_81725' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Adventure Weddings<\/p>\n<p>Puerto Vallarta, Mexico<\/p>\n<p>Toll Free: 1.866.731.81.52<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dennise@adventureweddingsvallarta.com","IpAddress":"187.146.166.254","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1343044403,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258213.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LasCaletas","Id":258213,"Name":"LasCaletas","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"122.15.103.61","IsFirstPost":fals