"TopicId":78435,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8ef7c486e8594517128335e4a2810e6c","RawContent":"[quote name=\"acw271011\" post=\"1897801\" timestamp=\"1433305715\"]\nI want blue shoes! And I&#039;m having a heck of a time finding what I want that fits![\/quote]so did I originally and that was the reason why I moved on. I couldn&#039;t find any that fit and that were reasonably comfortable :(. Now I love my pink shoes so it&#039;s all good, maybe blue shoes weren&#039;t meant to be for me.","Attachments":[],"Id":1897851,"PostDate":1433341608,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>acw271011, on 03 June 2015 - 12:28 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I want blue shoes! And I'm having a heck of a time finding what I want that fits!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>so did I originally and that was the reason why I moved on. I couldn't find any that fit and that were reasonably comfortable <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/>. Now I love my pink shoes so it's all good, maybe blue shoes weren't meant to be for me.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" al