i&#039;ll choose the gown what makes me feel comfortable and confident. that&#039;s describe me. the real me. Good luck!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1896368,"PostDate":1431678533,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>i think there are very good. but, i'm not too like the mermaid style. if i'm in your condition, i'll choose the gown what makes me feel comfortable and confident. that's describe me. the real me. Good luck!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"samwillow39@gmail.com","IpAddress":"114.121.164.128","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1430650422,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282964.jpg?_r=1431149209","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"samwillow","Id":282964,"Name":"samwillow","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"154.20.36.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79157,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":6,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c3504d61fa5f0d4a0ec66c2acd3a04a2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello again!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I want to thank you all again for giving me such great feedback on the dresses... I finally made a decision and ordered dress number one last night (the one with the frilly skirt)! :wub:&amp;nbsp;It really helped going&amp;nbsp;back to the store and trying them both on with all my accessories and hair&amp;nbsp;all done! &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m so relieved that I can finally check this off my to do list! Its going to be a long few months waiting for it to come in though.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1896519,"PostDate":1431901498,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello again!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I want to thank you all again for giving me such great feedback on the dresses... I finally made a decision and ordered dress number one last night (the one with the frilly skirt)! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wub.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wub:' \/>\u00a0It really helped going\u00a0back to the store and trying them both on with all my accessories and hair\u00a0all done! \u00a0I'm so relieved that I can finally check this off my to do list! Its going to be a long few months waiting for it to come in though.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"millar_devon@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"154.20.36.21","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1423314913,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282027.jpg?_r=1429713632","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Victoriabride","Id":282027,"Name":"Victoriabride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.4.91.11","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79157,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5bb1a057a0393acc7d51fc08177c4f2a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I love the one without lace and tierd ruffles. I think the second one just needs a small petticoat\/slip to fill it out more.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1897141,"PostDate":1432473274,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I love the one without lace and tierd ruffles. I think the second one just needs a small petticoat\/slip to fill it out more.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"foxystylinjules@gmail.com","IpAddress":"184.4.91.11","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1432468313,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283219.jpg?_r=1432484519","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"juliep81","Id":283219,"Name":"juliep81","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.28.11.171","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79157,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6cf3499d0ae410b4eac773f1b77d16f7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I love the one with the ruffles on the bottom. The details are stunning. Honestly you look great in both. Wish I had the figure for this style.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck ^_^&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1897144,"PostDate":1432480511,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I love the one with the ruffles on the bottom. The details are stunning. Honestly you look great in both. Wish I had the figure for this style.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/happy.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt='^_^' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"krista.cornish814@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.28.11.171","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1432419866,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283211.jpg?_r=1432591501","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":174,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"misskriss","Id":283211,"Name":"misskriss","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.15.187","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79157,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"12e7c5ceefe876b37cdebd9f31eec62d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Both are gorgeous but I&#039;m glad you chose #1. I love the tiered bottom! It&#039;s a style I really like.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1897163,"PostDate":1432512704,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Both are gorgeous but I'm glad you chose #1. I love the tiered bottom! It's a style I really like.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"117.213.15.75","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79157,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by davidmillers, 27 May 2015 - 03:38 AM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1432697926,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"eef43617a1e2be3053a3dad12dd25345","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&#039;Helvetica Neue&#039;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;\"&gt;The first was is beautiful! If you like that one the best, but aren&#039;t too sure about how it fits on you, try to see if you could get it tailored to the way you like it best. Dress 2 is great too - I think that it will be perfectly fine for an outdoor wedding and it makes you look amazing. As far as dress 3, if it didn&#039;t make you go WOW - then don&#039;t even bother. It&#039;s your wedding, not your mom&#039;s or your sister&#039;s. Although their opinion matters a lot, they don&#039;t have the final say - you do. If you don&#039;t want to go through the hassel of having dress 1 tailored, the I would go with dress 2 - hands down - no questions asked.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&#039;Helvetica Neue&#039;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;\"&gt;_______________________________&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"[url=\"http:\/\/www.feifei.gr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/04\/3ecf56cf39da5b75a8239427bac4adc6.jpg\"]http:\/\/www.feifei.gr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/04\/3ecf56cf39da5b75a8239427bac4adc6.jpg\"[\/url] alt=\"3ecf56cf39da5b75a8239427bac4adc6.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;[b][url=\"http:\/\/www.feifei.gr\/\"]http:\/\/www.feifei.gr\/[\/url][\/b]&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1897318,"PostDate":1432697901,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;\">The first was is beautiful! If you like that one the best, but aren't too sure about how it fits on you, try to see if you could get it tailored to the way you like it best. Dress 2 is great too - I think that it will be perfectly fine for an outdoor wedding and it makes you look amazing. As far as dress 3, if it didn't make you go WOW - then don't even bother. It's your wedding, not your mom's or your sister's. Although their opinion matters a lot, they don't have the final say - you do. If you don't want to go through the hassel of having dress 1 tailored, the I would go with dress 2 - hands down - no questions asked.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;\">_______________________________<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.feifei.gr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/04\/3ecf56cf39da5b75a8239427bac4adc6.jpg\" alt=\"3ecf56cf39da5b75a8239427bac4adc6.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><strong><strong class='bbc'><a href='http:\/\/www.feifei.gr\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.feifei.gr\/<\/a><\/strong><\/strong><\/div>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dinobravo02@gmail.com","IpAddress":"122.178.109.129","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1429849563,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"davidmillers","Id":282846,"Name":"davidmillers","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.101.223.7","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79157,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"34f48820fac70dc0f587f50dc0ded10a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;number 2. &amp;nbsp;detail is original&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1898581,"PostDate":1434331453,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>number 2. \u00a0detail is original<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dathotgal51@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"173.77.182.126","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1423457925,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282047.jpg?_r=1440384702","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"dathotgal","Id":282047,"Name":"dathotgal","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"162.156.66.92","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79157,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6bd7eb0311aacd9a390ffc7dc67920f3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I am picking number 1 stunning on you , congrats as to witch ever one u purchase they are both lovely&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1898957,"PostDate":1434845213,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I am picking number 1 stunning on you , congrats as to witch ever one u purchase they are both lovely<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rykellkan@telus.net","IpAddress":"207.216.32.36","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1330651299,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-252172.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"rykell","Id":252172,"Name":"rykell","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"114.121.129.137","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79157,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4e42ee8326526129aa52684b12459bd6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;i love the second one.. on the right. it&#039;s simple.. no ruffle&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1900310,"PostDate":1436766728,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>i love the second one.. on the right. it's simple.. no ruffle<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"samwillow39@gmail.com","IpAddress":"114.121.164.128","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1430650422,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282964.jpg?_r=1431149209","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"samwillow","Id":282964,"Name":"samwillow","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"122.15.103.61","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79157,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c2318408fd3ad8002b6ed5094da3b186","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I think the dress on the left more suits you.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1902968,"PostDate":1440057748,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I think the dress on the left more suits you.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rahulthakur01@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"122.15.103.61","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1438822568,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"rahulthakur01","Id":284300,"Name":"rahulthakur01","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79157","Title":"Please Help Me Choose A Dress!","LastPostDate":1440057748},"Pages":{"TotalItems":30,"TotalPages":3,"CurrentPage":20,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":10,"LastPage":20},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
