{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b8bb48d0f1933dbb7b973335b95a2f1f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;So I got LUCKY. Like BEYOND lucky!!! A coworker of my aunt had a dress she was going to give to Goodwill (Venus 7914). Knowing I was getting married she thought I would like it and sent it to me. Not only did I like it, I LOVED it!!! It was everything I wanted and more, much more then I could have afforded that&#039;s for sure!! We are getting married on the beach in Ponce Inlet, FL next month so I knew the giant train wasn&#039;t going to work. I took it to a local seamstress who took off the train and turned it into a shawl (there was so much beautiful beading I couldn&#039;t bare let it go to waste), shortend the front (I&#039;m 5&#039;2&#039;&#039; and going barefoot), and extended the modesty panel a bit (out of part of the train). I LOVE LOVE LOVE it even more now and can&#039;t wait to wear it in 27 days :) I&#039;m sorry for the picture quality, my mom took the pics on her cell phone. I will post better pictures next month when I get the best photos.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Model Photo&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\"\" data-id=\"223832\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223832\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Back with the train&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"223827\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223827\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"223828\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223828\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Back with the new shawl and no train&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"223829\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223829\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Front&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"223830\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223830\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Detail of the front beading&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\" \" data-id=\"223831\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223831\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1807637,"PostDate":1381954390,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>So I got LUCKY. Like BEYOND lucky!!! A coworker of my aunt had a dress she was going to give to Goodwill (Venus 7914). Knowing I was getting married she thought I would like it and sent it to me. Not only did I like it, I LOVED it!!! It was everything I wanted and more, much more then I could have afforded that's for sure!! We are getting married on the beach in Ponce Inlet, FL next month so I knew the giant train wasn't going to work. I took it to a local seamstress who took off the train and turned it into a shawl (there was so much beautiful beading I couldn't bare let it go to waste), shortend the front (I'm 5'2'' and going barefoot), and extended the modesty panel a bit (out of part of the train). I LOVE LOVE LOVE it even more now and can't wait to wear it in 27 days <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> I'm sorry for the picture quality, my mom took the pics on her cell phone. I will post better pictures next month when I get the best photos.<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>Model Photo<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"223832\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223832\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>Back with the train<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"223827\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223827\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"223828\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223828\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>Back with the new shawl and no train<\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"223829\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223829\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>Front<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"223830\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223830\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>Detail of the front beading<\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" \" data-id=\"223831\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223831\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"humrz28@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1381062008,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274038.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":172,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SkyHighT100","Id":274038,"Name":"SkyHighT100","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8ab6a83fa13dae47da700dee2def6731","RawContent":"Sach all the way!","Attachments":[],"Id":1807656,"PostDate":1381959915,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Sach all the way!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <