" \/&gt;\n \n My dress!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Soo pretty!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1807699,"PostDate":1381997630,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div class=\"quote-container\">Quote: <div class=\"quote-block\">Originally Posted by <strong>leannesmith<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"223826\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223826\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> My dress!<\/div> <\/div> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>Soo pretty!!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"m8chow@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"99.232.227.202","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1362599328,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266988.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":175,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"m8chow","Id":266988,"Name":"m8chow","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cea4d266bfa7f8aa65bcbed76a7563ab","RawContent":"&lt;div class=\"quote-container\"&gt; &lt;p&gt;soooo gorgeous Leanne!!!!!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Quote:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt;Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;leannesmith&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img alt=\"\" data-id=\"223826\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223826\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;\n \n My dress!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1807759,"PostDate":1382013769,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div class=\"quote-container\"> <p>soooo gorgeous Leanne!!!!!<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>Quote:<\/p> <div class=\"quote-block\">Originally Posted by <strong>leannesmith<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"223826\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223826\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> My dress!<\/div> <\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/73076-official-el-dorado-royaleel-dorado-casitas-royale-thread\/'>Official El Dorado Royale\/El Dorado Casitas Royale Thread<\/a>\u00a0<---check here for all info about EDR\/EDCR<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'>Wright Travel Agency<\/a> <--for all your Destination Wedding needs! Contact the experts and reduce your stress.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/5182-el-dorado-royale-edr-brides-post-here\/'>El Dorado Royale Brides Thread<\/a> <---come chat with other EDR brides<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/69372-allie-hs-edr-rm-mexico-11-5-2012-planning-thread\/'>AllieH's EDR 11-5-2012 Planning Thread<\/a> <--because it was so awesome","Email":"allisonmoore817@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.20.174.181","GroupId":55,"GroupName":"Resort\/Area Ambassadors","JoinDate":1309643480,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241884.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AllieH","Id":241884,"Name":"AllieH","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e9e4a209e4ab19aba092e5fea466f2b9","RawContent":"So I completely lucked into my dress. A coworker of my Aunt was about to give her dress to Goodwill. Knowing I was engaged my aunt sent it to me. It was amazing and so much more than I could have afforded at a bridal shop. We are getting married at Ponce Inlet Beach next month so I knew the train just wasn&#039;t going to work. I took the dress to a local seamstress and they worked some serious magic!!! Not wanting to let the beautiful beading of the train go to waste they made a new modesty panel for behind the corset and a shawl incase it gets chilly. I am SO excited to wear it in just 26 days!! I&#039;ll be sure to post better photos after the wedding, these were from my moms cellphone. Model photo: [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223865\/width\/200\/height\/400[\/img] Original back: [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223866\/width\/200\/height\/400[\/img] After alterations: [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223867\/width\/200\/height\/400[\/img] [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223868\/width\/200\/height\/400[\/img]","Attachments":[],"Id":1807767,"PostDate":1382015775,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                So I completely lucked into my dress. A coworker of my Aunt was about to give her dress to Goodwill. Knowing I was engaged my aunt sent it to me. It was amazing and so much more than I could have afforded at a bridal shop. We are getting married at Ponce Inlet Beach next month so I knew the train just wasn't going to work. I took the dress to a local seamstress and they worked some serious magic!!! Not wanting to let the beautiful beading of the train go to waste they made a new modesty panel for behind the corset and a shawl incase it gets chilly. I am SO excited to wear it in just 26 days!! I'll be sure to post better photos after the wedding, these were from my moms cellphone. Model photo: <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223865\/width\/200\/height\/400' alt='Posted Image'  \/><\/span> Original back: <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223866\/width\/200\/height\/400' alt='Posted Image'  \/><\/span> After alterations: <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223867\/width\/200\/height\/400' alt='Posted Image'  \/><\/span> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223868\/width\/200\/height\/400' alt='Posted Image'  \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"humrz28@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1381062008,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274038.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":172,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SkyHighT100","Id":274038,"Name":"SkyHighT100","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c374b2f0cbe7c4b2ad8dee23e626229d","RawContent":"&lt;div class=\"quote-container\"&gt;Quote: &lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt;Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;leannesmith&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img alt=\"\" data-id=\"223826\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223826\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;\n \n My dress!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Soo pretty.&amp;nbsp; The back is very sexy!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1807842,"PostDate":1382030511,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div class=\"quote-container\">Quote: <div class=\"quote-block\">Originally Posted by <strong>leannesmith<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"223826\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223826\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> My dress!<\/div> <\/div> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>Soo pretty.\u00a0 The back is very sexy!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sunandfun2013@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.33.41.254","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1361225297,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266260.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"CdnBrideJoanne","Id":266260,"Name":"CdnBrideJoanne","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e384f6639a30b67eff2f25b322792332","RawContent":"&lt;div class=\"quote-container\"&gt; &lt;p&gt;Fits like a glove, looks beautiful!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Quote:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt;Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;SkyHighT100&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/&gt;\n \n So I completely lucked into my dress. A coworker of my Aunt was about to give her dress to Goodwill. Knowing I was engaged my aunt sent it to me. It was amazing and so much more than I could have afforded at a bridal shop. We are getting married at Ponce Inlet Beach next month so I knew the train just wasn&#039;t going to work. I took the dress to a local seamstress and they worked some serious magic!!! Not wanting to let the beautiful beading of the train go to waste they made a new modesty panel for behind the corset and a shawl incase it gets chilly. I am SO excited to wear it in just 26 days!! I&#039;ll be sure to post better photos after the wedding, these were from my moms cellphone.\n \n Model photo:\n &lt;img alt=\"\" data-id=\"223865\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223865\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;\n \n Original back:\n &lt;img alt=\"\" data-id=\"223866\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223866\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;\n \n After alterations:\n &lt;img alt=\"\" data-id=\"223867\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223867\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img alt=\"\" data-id=\"223868\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223868\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1808031,"PostDate":1382089241,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div class=\"quote-container\"> <p>Fits like a glove, looks beautiful!<\/p> <p>\u00a0<\/p> <p>Quote:<\/p> <div class=\"quote-block\">Originally Posted by <strong>SkyHighT100<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> So I completely lucked into my dress. A coworker of my Aunt was about to give her dress to Goodwill. Knowing I was engaged my aunt sent it to me. It was amazing and so much more than I could have afforded at a bridal shop. We are getting married at Ponce Inlet Beach next month so I knew the train just wasn't going to work. I took the dress to a local seamstress and they worked some serious magic!!! Not wanting to let the beautiful beading of the train go to waste they made a new modesty panel for behind the corset and a shawl incase it gets chilly. I am SO excited to wear it in just 26 days!! I'll be sure to post better photos after the wedding, these were from my moms cellphone.<br \/> <br \/> Model photo:<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"223865\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223865\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Original back:<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"223866\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223866\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> After alterations:<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"223867\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223867\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"223868\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223868\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/div> <\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"geodestiny@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.86.43.254","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1364215595,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267773.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SoonMrsD","Id":267773,"Name":"SoonMrsD","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"641970e7bece48d156c95f85f1864b27","RawContent":"@skyhighT100 that&#039;s awesome they did a great job! Now u have ur something borrowed!","Attachments":[],"Id":1808156,"PostDate":1382117053,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @skyhighT100 that's awesome they did a great job! Now u have ur something borrowed!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"vanessabishop@live.ca","IpAddress":"99.228.75.138","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1359259143,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265152.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":163,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"VanessaBB","Id":265152,"Name":"VanessaBB","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":8285,"TotalPages":829,"CurrentPage":7810,"NextPage":7820,"PreviousPage":7800,"LastPage":8280},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value"