{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a5c44686f78300bfc0c766ba0853c242","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thank you!! They really did do an amazing job! And let me tell you, the dress is SO much more comfortable without all that extra weight, lol.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1808294,"PostDate":1382211420,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thank you!! They really did do an amazing job! And let me tell you, the dress is SO much more comfortable without all that extra weight, lol.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"humrz28@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1381062008,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274038.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":172,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SkyHighT100","Id":274038,"Name":"SkyHighT100","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"35ffa7599a55db5df721ab952c5a2546","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;SkyHigh, it&#039;s beautiful! &amp;nbsp;Your seamstress did a great job.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1808305,"PostDate":1382216058,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>SkyHigh, it's beautiful! \u00a0Your seamstress did a great job.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"m8chow@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"99.232.227.202","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1362599328,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-266988.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":175,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"m8chow","Id":266988,"Name":"m8chow","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"92cf04a01cf843aee862073507d35e1b","RawContent":"&lt;div class=\"quote-container\"&gt;Quote: &lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt;Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;SkyHighT100&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/&gt;\n \n So I completely lucked into my dress. A coworker of my Aunt was about to give her dress to Goodwill. Knowing I was engaged my aunt sent it to me. It was amazing and so much more than I could have afforded at a bridal shop. We are getting married at Ponce Inlet Beach next month so I knew the train just wasn&#039;t going to work. I took the dress to a local seamstress and they worked some serious magic!!! Not wanting to let the beautiful beading of the train go to waste they made a new modesty panel for behind the corset and a shawl incase it gets chilly. I am SO excited to wear it in just 26 days!! I&#039;ll be sure to post better photos after the wedding, these were from my moms cellphone.\n \n Model photo:\n &lt;img alt=\"\" data-id=\"223865\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223865\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;\n \n Original back:\n &lt;img alt=\"\" data-id=\"223866\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223866\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;\n \n After alterations:\n &lt;img alt=\"\" data-id=\"223867\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223867\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img alt=\"\" data-id=\"223868\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223868\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;p&gt;Looks great on you. I like your new update to the dress. I love how you found a purpose for the train as well. That&#039;s so flippin&#039; awesome and creative. It&#039;s like you were on that show \"something old something new\" hahaha&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1808743,"PostDate":1382394413,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div class=\"quote-container\">Quote: <div class=\"quote-block\">Originally Posted by <strong>SkyHighT100<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> So I completely lucked into my dress. A coworker of my Aunt was about to give her dress to Goodwill. Knowing I was engaged my aunt sent it to me. It was amazing and so much more than I could have afforded at a bridal shop. We are getting married at Ponce Inlet Beach next month so I knew the train just wasn't going to work. I took the dress to a local seamstress and they worked some serious magic!!! Not wanting to let the beautiful beading of the train go to waste they made a new modesty panel for behind the corset and a shawl incase it gets chilly. I am SO excited to wear it in just 26 days!! I'll be sure to post better photos after the wedding, these were from my moms cellphone.<br \/> <br \/> Model photo:<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"223865\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223865\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Original back:<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"223866\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223866\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> After alterations:<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"223867\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223867\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"223868\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/223868\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/div> <\/div> <p>Looks great on you. I like your new update to the dress. I love how you found a purpose for the train as well. That's so flippin' awesome and creative. It's like you were on that show \"something old something new\" hahaha<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Happily married to the love of my life- since July 5, 2013<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"evelynlvazquez@gmail.com","IpAddress":"165.155.200.66","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1343669362,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258580.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"EVKnowsitall","Id":258580,"Name":"EVKnowsitall","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":71,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f7b3def576667f0741aeeeef229c82fc","RawContent":"@miriam I prefer the flower gown alot ! What is the material of the second gown looks very heavy","Attachments":[],"Id":1808790,"PostDate":1382423248,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @miriam I prefer the flower gown alot ! What is the material of the second gown looks very heavy\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"vanessabishop@live.ca","IpAddress":"99.228.75.138","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1359259143,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265152.jpeg?_r=