or a long time between the Chapel mermaid gown and flowers wedding dress&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\"\" data-id=\"224239\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224239\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;img alt=\"\" data-id=\"224240\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224240\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=\"\" data-id=\"224241\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224241\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;p&gt;I love both dresses....who are the designers?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1808812,"PostDate":1382433679,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div class=\"quote-container\">Quote: <div class=\"quote-block\">Originally Posted by <strong>Miriam005<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> \u00a0 <p>how do you think of the two dulex wedding dress,in fact,I havn't paid for it ,I vacillated for a long time between the Chapel mermaid gown and flowers wedding dress<\/p> <p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"224239\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/224239\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"224240\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bes