 to get it made!!! \u00a0But I have to have it and can not find the original maker of the dress! \u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"angelbaby91179@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"24.192.42.235","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1437683929,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284108.jpg?_r=1439315189","PhotoWidth":170,"PhotoHeight":258,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"lisalee","Id":284108,"Name":"lisalee","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.236.231.216","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":30824,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d878d433188e1e8ad60fb060ea9ca1d6","RawContent":"Any websites that ships to canada!? Looking for something like this if anybody seen something similar please let me know :) \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1901747,"PostDate":1438616246,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Any websites that ships to canada!? Looking for something like this if anybody seen something similar please let me know <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> <a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1901747]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_08_2015\/post-28394